# ============================================================================
#  Example.SystematicMIDISLanguageFile  (.SMLF)
#  Systematics TRILLION MIDI maker - EXAMPLE language file
#
#  This file exists so you can SEE the language switching in action. Every
#  string is wrapped in [EX] ... [EX] markers. Select "Example" in
#  Settings > Language and the whole app switches to these strings instantly,
#  proving that translation works.
#
#  Copy this file to make a real translation (e.g. Spanish.SMLF), remove the
#  [EX] markers and translate the text. Keep the {placeholders} as they are.
# ============================================================================

